<title>USA: Kohl's Corp Q4 Feb 1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Kohl's Corp Q4 Feb 1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MENOMONEE FALLS, Wis. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.70		   $ 0.57</p>
<p> Net			 51,972		   42,087</p>
<p> Revs		     846,933		  707,018</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  73,917		   73,699</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: LIFO adjustment for the Q4 was a pretax charge of $1.4 million ($0.01/shr after taxes). This contrasts to a credit of $5.1 million or $0.04/shr last year.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.39		    $0.99</p>
<p> Net			102,478		   72,652</p>
<p> Revs		   2,388,221		1,925,669</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  73,852		   73,585</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: For the year, the company LIFO adjustment was a charge of $5.2 million (or $0.04/shr) compared to a credit of $1.4 million (or $0.01/shr). With the liquidation of electronics now complete, Kohl's said there should be no future LIFO impact.</p>
<p>	 ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
